{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04275","headline":"春日离长安客中言怀 · 骆宾王","name":"春日离长安客中言怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年华开早律，霁色荡芳晨。\n城阙千门晓，山河四望春。\n御沟通太液，戚里对平津。\n宝瑟调中妇，金罍引上宾。\n剧谈推曼倩，惊坐揖陈遵。\n意气一言合，风期万里亲。\n自惟安直道，守拙忌因人。\n谈器非先木，图荣异後薪。\n揶揄慙路鬼，憔悴切波臣。\n玄草终疲汉，乌裘几滞秦。\n生涯无岁月，岐路有风尘。\n还嗟太行道，处处白头新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04275.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04275","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}